    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "好久不见！时间过得真快，又到十一月了，祝你感恩节快乐！",
      "traditional": "好久不見！時間過得真快，又到十一月了，祝你感恩節快樂！",
      "pinyin": "hǎo jiǔ bu jiàn shí jiān guò de zhēn kuài yòu dào shí yī yuè le zhù nǐ gǎn ēn jié kuài lè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Long time no see! Time really flies. It’s November again. I wish you a Happy Thanksgiving!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我回中国已经十几年了。",
      "traditional": "我回中國已經十幾年了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ huí zhōng guó yǐ jīng shí jǐ nián le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "虽然中国没有感恩节火鸡，但我总是会在这一天想起你妈妈做的火鸡，真的太好吃了！",
      "traditional": "雖然中國沒有感恩節火雞，但我總是會在這一天想起你媽媽做的火雞，真的太好吃了！",
      "pinyin": "suī rán zhōng guó méi yǒu gǎn ēn jié huǒ jī dàn wǒ zǒng shì huì zài zhè yì tiān xiǎng qǐ nǐ mā ma zuò de huǒ jī zhēn de tài hǎo chī le",
      "english": "I came back to China more than 10 years ago."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Although there’s no Thanksgiving turkey in China, I always think of your mom’s turkey on this day. It was really delicious!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "记得那时候，我刚去美国。",
      "traditional": "記得那時候，我剛去美國。",
      "pinyin": "jì de nà shí hou wǒ gāng qù měi guó",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "学校的课非常多，老师们说话都很快，我每天都很累。",
      "traditional": "學校的課非常多，老師們說話都很快，我每天都很累。",
      "pinyin": "xué xiào de kè fēi cháng duō lǎo shī men shuō huà dōu hěn kuài wǒ měi tiān dōu hěn lèi",
      "english": "I remember the time when I had just arrived in the US."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "我很想家。你知道以后，请我去你家，和你的家人们一起过感恩节。",
      "traditional": "我很想家。你知道以後，請我去你家，和你的家人們一起過感恩節。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hěn xiǎng jiā nǐ zhī dào yǐ hòu qǐng wǒ qù nǐ jiā hé nǐ de jiā rén men yì qǐ guò gǎn ēn jié",
      "english": "I had many classes at school, and the teachers spoke very quickly. I was tired every day."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "那时候，我真的很高兴。和你的家人们坐在一起吃饭，让我找到了家的感觉。",
      "traditional": "那時候，我真的很高興。和你的家人們坐在一起吃飯，讓我找到了家的感覺。",
      "pinyin": "nà shí hou wǒ zhēn de hěn gāo xìng hé nǐ de jiā rén men zuò zài yì qǐ chī fàn ràng wǒ zhǎo dào le jiā de gǎn jué",
      "english": "I was homesick. After you found out about that, you invited me to your home to spend Thanksgiving with your family."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I was really happy at that time. Sitting and eating with your family made me feel at home."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "这些快乐的事情已经过去十几年了，但我一直记得。",
      "traditional": "這些快樂的事情已經過去十幾年了，但我一直記得。",
      "pinyin": "zhè xiē kuài lè de shì qing yǐ jīng guò qù shí jǐ nián le dàn wǒ yì zhí jì de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "现在又到感恩节了，让我再说一次感恩节快乐！欢迎你有时间来中国看看！",
      "traditional": "現在又到感恩節了，讓我再說一次感恩節快樂！歡迎你有時間來中國看看！",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài yòu dào gǎn ēn jié le ràng wǒ zài shuō yí cì gǎn ēn jié kuài lè huān yíng nǐ yǒu shí jiān lái zhōng guó kàn kan",
      "english": "It’s been more than 10 years since that happy time, but I have always remembered it."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Now that it’s Thanksgiving again, let me say Happy Thanksgiving one more time! You are welcome to visit China sometime!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "小谢",
      "traditional": "小謝",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo xiè",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
