    "sentence_translations": [
      "I Wish You a Happy Thanksgiving",
      "",
      "Ben,",
      "",
      "Long time no see! Time really flies. It’s November again. I wish you a Happy Thanksgiving!",
      "",
      "I came back to China more than 10 years ago.",
      "Although there’s no Thanksgiving turkey in China, I always think of your mom’s turkey on this day. It was really delicious!",
      "",
      "I remember the time when I had just arrived in the US.",
      "I had many classes at school, and the teachers spoke very quickly. I was tired every day.",
      "I was homesick. After you found out about that, you invited me to your home to spend Thanksgiving with your family.",
      "I was really happy at that time. Sitting and eating with your family made me feel at home.",
      "",
      "It’s been more than 10 years since that happy time, but I have always remembered it.",
      "Now that it’s Thanksgiving again, let me say Happy Thanksgiving one more time! You are welcome to visit China sometime!",
      "",
      "Little Xie"
    ]
  }
